#align(right)[30 October 2026]

Dear Mrs Ellison,

Thank you for your patience about the waiting list. A half plot has
come free on the lower field, and your name is at the top of the
list. If you would like it, the rent is £27 for the year from
1 January, and the plot is yours from the day we receive it.

The secretary can show you the plot any Saturday morning.

Yours sincerely,

#v(18pt)
*J. Hartley* \
Secretary, Bramble Lane Allotment Society
